mapping "V4319.1" source="V4319" target="214640008" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V4319 is a Swedish national extension of ICD-10 V4x adding activity context
        (sport/leisure/work/unspecified) to a car-occupant injury in collision with car, pick-up truck
        or van. Role: passenger. Target SNOMED CT 437738 = Motor vehicle accident off public road, the
        standard crosswalk target for the corresponding base ICD-10 V4x category (e.g.
        V43.0/V43.5/V43.4). Activity and role granularity present in the Swedish source has no SNOMED CT
        representation; target captures the accident mechanism. broader: target subsumes the source's
        accident type; activity/role detail is lost. : verified crosswalk from the parent ICD-10 code,
        one level broader.
        """
}
